{"id":"d467a7b6bbdb1c63","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low-antibasis.md","title":"Low Antibasis Theorem","display":"thm-low-antibasis — Low Antibasis Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low-antibasis","aliases":["20-thm-low-antibasis"],"display":"thm-low-antibasis — Low Antibasis Theorem","chapter":"9","section":"9.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.6.1；Lemma 9.6.2","source_pdf_pages":[212,213],"source_printed_pages":[180,181],"depends_on":["[[20-df-basis]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding]]","[[20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low-antibasis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low-antibasis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-antibasis — Low Antibasis Theorem"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.6.1；Lemma 9.6.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>180</span><span>181</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a03c2828834ee687\" href=\"?note=a03c2828834ee687\" title=\"20-df-basis\">20-df-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a2e45aeae7b65467\" href=\"?note=a2e45aeae7b65467\" title=\"20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding\">20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b650dc2733f4802d\" href=\"?note=b650dc2733f4802d\" title=\"20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees\">20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=L_1\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(D=L_1\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Antibasis}\">\\(\\operatorname{Antibasis}\\)</span> 按度的所有代表元定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_T0&#39;\">\\(K\\equiv_T0&#39;\\)</span>。对有限二进制串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\eta\">\\(\\alpha,\\eta\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta\">\\(\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta\\)</span> 表示对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;|\\eta|\">\\(n&lt;|\\eta|\\)</span>，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的计算只查询 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 已定义的位且停止为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(n)\">\\(\\eta(n)\\)</span>。这是有限多个停止历史组成的 c.e. 关系，保留于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的延长；要求输出为完整二进制初段，不能只给一个可能留孔的输出坐标。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a03c2828834ee687\" href=\"?note=a03c2828834ee687\" title=\"20-df-basis\">20-df-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a2e45aeae7b65467\" href=\"?note=a2e45aeae7b65467\" title=\"20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding\">20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b650dc2733f4802d\" href=\"?note=b650dc2733f4802d\" title=\"20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees\">20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}antibasis}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Antibasis}(D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}antibasis}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Antibasis}(D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明逆否命题：任取缺一个度的有效闭类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=[T]\">\\(\\mathcal C=[T]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可计算；构造非零低度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\deg_T(A)\\)</span>，使其没有任何代表在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 建有限串的增长链，按每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的三种任务顺序执行；每步最后再补一位，保证长度趋于无穷。</p>\n<p>（1）不可计算性。取当前新坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\sigma|\">\\(n=|\\sigma|\\)</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(n)\">\\(\\varphi_e(n)\\)</span> 是否停止；若停为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，赋相反位，否则赋 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。因此任何全二进制可计算函数均与最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 有一个分歧。</p>\n<p>（2）跳跃。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 判定 c.e. 问题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\rho\\succeq\\sigma\\,[\\Phi_e^\\rho(e)\\downarrow]\">\\(\\exists\\rho\\succeq\\sigma\\,[\\Phi_e^\\rho(e)\\downarrow]\\)</span>。若有，搜出并延长到见证；否则继续延长当前串。前者迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in A&#39;\">\\(e\\in A&#39;\\)</span>，后者的所有延长均保持不停止。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可重现有限阶段构造并读取该决定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\le_TK\">\\(A&#39;\\le_TK\\)</span>；一般跳跃定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(K\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 低。</p>\n<p>（3）避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的度代表。先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 判定是否有当前串以上的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>，产生不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的完整有限二进制输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>。若有就延长到它；任何最终全二进制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> 保留该坏前缀，故不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span>。若没有，对候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 定义 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\rho\">\\(V_\\rho\\)</span>，收集其以上的不相容完整二进制输出对。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 逐个判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\rho=\\varnothing\">\\(V_\\rho=\\varnothing\\)</span> 并搜索一个无分裂的延长。该搜索必终止，否则上一引理产生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的普通可计算完美嵌入，完美嵌入度定理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span> 包含所有度，与设定矛盾。</p>\n<p>在无分裂延长 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A=h\\in2^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi_e^A=h\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 全定义，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(n)\">\\(h(n)\\)</span> 可普通搜索某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\succeq\\rho\">\\(\\alpha\\succeq\\rho\\)</span> 及完整有限二进制输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\eta|&gt;n\">\\(|\\eta|&gt;n\\)</span>。真正的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 计算给有限见证，故搜索终止；若找到的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(n)\\ne h(n)\">\\(\\eta(n)\\ne h(n)\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的有限输出初段就构成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\rho\">\\(V_\\rho\\)</span> 的一对分裂，矛盾。因此输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(n)\">\\(\\eta(n)\\)</span> 正确，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>每个全二进制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\le_TA\">\\(h\\le_TA\\)</span> 遂满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\notin\\mathcal C\">\\(h\\notin\\mathcal C\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 可计算。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 非可计算，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\equiv_TA\">\\(h\\equiv_TA\\)</span> 都不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中的该非零低度没有代表，给 Antibasis 的逆否命题。空类也不影响构造：坏前缀任务立即可选，其他两类任务照常构造非零低集合。证明不把寻找“没有分裂”的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 条件误说成普通有效搜索，也不把计算单个坐标的留孔输出当成分裂树见证。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 180–181 / PDF 212–213。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-basis","status":"resolved","id":"a03c2828834ee687","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a2e45aeae7b65467","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding]]","embed":